10. Do not reload layers for existing contexts.

11. Do not register layers for empty local
    parameter maps.

12. Preserve lifecycle cleanup and prevent
    orphan configuration layers.

13. Do not implement CLASS or METHOD loading yet.

14. Do not modify the resolver, legacy properties
    manager or existing production listeners.

